  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_Prisoner>囚犯</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_Prisoner>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_Slave>奴隸</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_Slave>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_Colonist>殖民者</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_Colonist>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonColonist>非殖民者</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonColonist>
