  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MapName>地圖 {0}</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MapName>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupDefaults>按身分預設顯示頭髮</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupDefaults>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupTooltip>為這組未滿 3 歲的嬰幼兒顯示已有髮型。個人設定優先。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividual>已載入地圖上的嬰幼兒</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividual>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividualDesc>個人設定隨目前存檔保存。顯示頭髮會使用角色已有的髮型。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividualDesc>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairLoadGame>載入存檔後，可以逐一設定嬰幼兒的頭髮。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairLoadGame>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairNoBabies>已載入的地圖上沒有嬰幼兒。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairNoBabies>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairDefault>沿用預設</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairDefault>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairShow>顯示頭髮</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairShow>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairHide>隱藏頭髮</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairHide>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairPawnDetails>{0} · {1} · {2} · {3} 日齡\n{4} · #{5}</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairPawnDetails>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MapExit>離圖</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MapExit>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExit>允許嬰幼兒自行走出地圖</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExit>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExitTooltip>允許這組嬰幼兒在無事可做或與隊伍走散時自行走向出口。設定影響新工作。釋放、玩家指令和隊伍按原定職責撤離照常生效。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExitTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SkipSafeToddlerCribReturn>安全時不抱幼兒回嬰兒床</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SkipSafeToddlerCribReturn>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SkipSafeToddlerCribReturnTooltip>這組能自行活動的幼兒待在允許區域內，且溫度安全時，殖民者會讓他們自由活動。倒地救援和醫療照護照常進行。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SkipSafeToddlerCribReturnTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFood>提供食物補給</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFood>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFoodTooltip>符合條件的嬰幼兒進入殖民地地圖或隨旅行隊伍生成時會獲得食物。非殖民者限非敵對派系。隨行兒童也可能獲得便攜口糧。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFoodTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarried>背負時自動餵食</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarried>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarriedTooltip>在殖民地地圖上，這組被背負的嬰幼兒飢餓時，會消耗自己或背負者隨身攜帶的嬰兒食物。非殖民者限非敵對派系。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarriedTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravan>玩家商隊協助餵食</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravan>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravanTooltip>這組幼兒餓了又還沒學會自己吃飯時，玩家商隊會用隨隊攜帶的嬰兒食物餵他們。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravanTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacks>偷吃零食</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacks>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacksTooltip>殖民地的幼兒和兒童在特定時段閒下來時，可能會偷吃零食。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacksTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathing>幼兒自動洗澡</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathing>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathingTooltip>啟用 Dubs Bad Hygiene 後，符合條件的幼兒會自己找地方洗澡。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathingTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowers>跟上自然奔跑的孩子</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowers>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowersTooltip>孩子開始自然奔跑時，附近的幼兒和兒童可能會跟上。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowersTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesire>嬰幼兒主動求抱</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesire>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesireTooltip>殖民地的嬰幼兒有時會哭著求抱，附近的照料者可以前去抱起他們。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesireTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughts>嬰幼兒與家人的同房心情</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughts>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughtsTooltip>根據同房睡覺的人，為嬰幼兒及家人套用本模組的臥室心情效果。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughtsTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoption>收養友方嬰兒</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoption>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoptionTooltip>允許收養來自非敵對派系、未滿一歲的嬰兒。囚犯仍按一般方式招募。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoptionTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwill>剝下嬰幼兒衣物時保留派系好感</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwill>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwillTooltip>剝下嬰幼兒的衣物時，保留其派系對你的好感。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwillTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtection>留住綺羅委託孤兒</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtection>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtectionTooltip>以後遇到綺羅委託孤兒事件時，嬰兒會暫時昏倒，留在原地等候收養。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtectionTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFits>哭笑時仍可參與活動</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFits>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFitsTooltip>嬰幼兒哭泣或咯咯笑時，仍有資格參與玩耍及部分群體活動，也能留在運輸工具內。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFitsTooltip>
</LanguageData>
